OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CDoctors begin fresh strike over pay    
OL,5,Cdispute                                
OL,6,GConsultants and specialist doctors     
OL,7,Ghave begun a 24-hour strike as part of 
OL,8,Gan ongoing dispute over pay.           
OL,10,FIt follows a separate 24-hour strike   
OL,11,Fon Friday in which resident doctors    
OL,12,Ftook industrial action as part of the  
OL,13,Fsame dispute.                          
OL,15,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)  
OL,16,Frejected a recommended 3.5% pay rise   
OL,17,Fand wants to restore the value of      
OL,18,Fdoctors' pay to 2008 levels.           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
