OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CPedestrian dies in County Donegal crash
OL,5,GA man aged in his 40s has been knocked 
OL,6,Gdown and killed in County Donegal.     
OL,8,FHe was hit by a car on the R238 at     
OL,9,FDrumskellan near the border village of 
OL,10,FMuff at about 20:30 local time on      
OL,11,FSunday.                                
OL,13,FThe man was pronounced dead at the     
OL,14,Fscene and his body has been taken to   
OL,15,FLetterkenny University Hospital for a  
OL,16,Fpost-mortem examination.               
OL,18,FThe road remains closed for technical  
OL,19,Fexamination by Garda (Irish police)    
OL,20,Fforensic collision investigators and   
OL,21,Fdiversions are in place.               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
