OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CO'Neill 'relief' as Cross return to    
OL,5,CUlster decider                         
OL,6,GRelief was the overriding emotion for  
OL,7,GCrossmaglen forward Oisin O'Neill as   
OL,8,Ghe helped the club reach their first   
OL,9,GUlster club final in 11 years.         
OL,11,FCross spent two years away from the    
OL,12,FUlster club scene as Clann Eireann and 
OL,13,FMadden claimed the Orchard club title, 
OL,14,Fso a winning return at the provincial  
OL,15,Fstage is a welcome one for the 11-time 
OL,16,Fchampions.                             
OL,18,FOn Sunday at Pairc Esler, the Armagh   
OL,19,Fmen saw off Edendork with four points  
OL,20,Fto spare.                              
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
